1
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:12,000
"Echo Of A Letter"
(Episode 10)

2
00:00:25,199 --> 00:00:26,240
Mr. Zhao! Mr. Zhao!

3
00:00:26,320 --> 00:00:26,959
No, no, no.

4
00:00:27,039 --> 00:00:28,136
President Zhao, President Zhao!

5
00:00:28,160 --> 00:00:28,799
It's all my fault.

6
00:00:28,879 --> 00:00:29,879
Sorry for the scare.

7
00:00:33,679 --> 00:00:34,679
Careful.

8
00:00:36,600 --> 00:00:37,039
I'm fine.

9
00:00:37,119 --> 00:00:38,039
Chen Wan, I'm fine.

10
00:00:38,119 --> 00:00:39,119
It's okay now.

11
00:00:40,520 --> 00:00:41,319
Calm down.

12
00:00:41,399 --> 00:00:42,399
It's all over.

13
00:00:44,880 --> 00:00:45,880
I'm okay.

14
00:00:48,679 --> 00:00:49,679
Breathe.

15
00:00:55,520 --> 00:00:56,936
Thankfully, it's just a flesh wound.

16
00:00:56,960 --> 00:00:58,320
Get some rest, Mr. Zhao.

17
00:01:09,760 --> 00:01:10,760
Zhao Shengge.

18
00:01:12,680 --> 00:01:13,680
What is it?

19
00:01:14,480 --> 00:01:15,896
Are you still willing to talk to me?

20
00:01:15,920 --> 00:01:16,920
Chen Wan.

21
00:01:18,079 --> 00:01:20,560
I, Zhao Shengge, am
always a man of my word.

22
00:01:22,400 --> 00:01:23,400
All right.

23
00:01:24,959 --> 00:01:26,040
I'll head back then.

24
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:32,760
You feel wronged, don't you?

25
00:01:32,840 --> 00:01:34,239
No.

26
00:01:34,319 --> 00:01:35,799
I just think—.

27
00:01:37,599 --> 00:01:38,599
I don't feel wronged.

28
00:01:39,319 --> 00:01:40,319
Chen Wan.

29
00:01:41,239 --> 00:01:42,799
Do you think you did anything wrong?

30
00:01:44,239 --> 00:01:45,319
Yes, I did.

31
00:01:46,799 --> 00:01:47,919
I doubt you really think so.

32
00:01:49,920 --> 00:01:51,359
Aren't you wondering

33
00:01:51,439 --> 00:01:54,159
how, after your foolproof, airtight plan,

34
00:01:54,239 --> 00:01:55,799
I still managed to get out?

35
00:01:56,319 --> 00:02:00,120
You're probably thinking about how to
be even more thorough next time, right?

36
00:02:01,359 --> 00:02:02,896
If you don't think you did anything wrong,

37
00:02:02,920 --> 00:02:04,320
what is there for us to talk about?

38
00:02:08,120 --> 00:02:09,120
I'm sorry.

39
00:02:13,800 --> 00:02:14,800
I'm sorry.

40
00:02:17,080 --> 00:02:18,080
I'm so sorry.

41
00:02:22,280 --> 00:02:23,280
Chen Wan.

42
00:02:24,439 --> 00:02:26,279
Could you just be a
little kinder to yourself?

43
00:02:27,319 --> 00:02:28,480
I'm not mistreating myself.

44
00:02:28,560 --> 00:02:29,639
You're not?

45
00:02:29,719 --> 00:02:31,479
Then why did you leave
me in the panic room?

46
00:02:32,439 --> 00:02:33,680
Stop trying to lie to me.

47
00:02:34,800 --> 00:02:35,720
Even now,

48
00:02:35,800 --> 00:02:36,959
you're still lying.

49
00:02:37,039 --> 00:02:38,719
We really have nothing left to talk about.

50
00:02:40,400 --> 00:02:42,240
You left the only way out for me.

51
00:02:42,800 --> 00:02:45,240
You forced the last of
the bullets into my hands.

52
00:02:46,280 --> 00:02:49,480
You'd rather ruin things between us and
sacrifice yourself just to keep me safe.

53
00:02:49,879 --> 00:02:50,879
Isn't that right?

54
00:02:51,560 --> 00:02:52,560
Chen Wan.

55
00:02:54,199 --> 00:02:55,639
You have feelings for me, don't you?

56
00:03:02,159 --> 00:03:03,319
Yes, I do.

57
00:03:09,439 --> 00:03:10,119
Even though I know

58
00:03:10,199 --> 00:03:12,639
my credibility with you
is probably down to zero,

59
00:03:13,199 --> 00:03:15,079
I really don't have any ulterior motives.

60
00:03:15,159 --> 00:03:16,800
I won't bother you anymore.

61
00:03:17,560 --> 00:03:19,120
Words must be kept this time.

62
00:03:20,879 --> 00:03:23,680
Mr. Zhao, if you really
don't want to see me,

63
00:03:24,199 --> 00:03:25,376
I can take another boat back—

64
00:03:25,400 --> 00:03:26,400
How will you prove it?

65
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:33,280
I promise I'll never show up

66
00:03:33,360 --> 00:03:35,239
anywhere you might be.

67
00:03:35,319 --> 00:03:37,639
I'll delete all your contact info.

68
00:03:37,719 --> 00:03:38,799
You can have someone check

69
00:03:38,879 --> 00:03:40,119
the roadshows,

70
00:03:40,199 --> 00:03:41,000
the patents,

71
00:03:41,080 --> 00:03:42,280
the R&amp;D roster...

72
00:03:42,360 --> 00:03:43,920
You can take my name off all of them.

73
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:45,919
If that's still not enough, Mr. Zhao,

74
00:03:47,280 --> 00:03:48,880
I can leave Haishi.

75
00:03:48,960 --> 00:03:49,960
What I'm asking is,

76
00:03:51,039 --> 00:03:52,360
if you have feelings for me,

77
00:03:52,960 --> 00:03:54,240
how are you going to prove it?

78
00:03:57,240 --> 00:03:58,240
Prove what?

79
00:04:00,520 --> 00:04:02,455
Don't tell me your
feelings for me are a lie, too.

80
00:04:02,479 --> 00:04:03,040
They're not.

81
00:04:03,120 --> 00:04:04,240
Then prove it.

82
00:04:06,240 --> 00:04:07,240
I...

83
00:04:08,199 --> 00:04:09,879
I don't know how to prove it.

84
00:04:12,800 --> 00:04:14,039
Then figure it out.

85
00:04:15,919 --> 00:04:17,040
Prove it to me,

86
00:04:17,920 --> 00:04:19,399
and I'll believe you.

87
00:04:27,399 --> 00:04:28,640
I don't know.

88
00:04:28,720 --> 00:04:29,720
You don't know?

89
00:04:34,759 --> 00:04:35,759
Yes, you do.

90
00:04:38,079 --> 00:04:39,120
Think about it.

91
00:04:41,439 --> 00:04:42,560
Think hard.

92
00:05:40,160 --> 00:05:42,360
Sweeter than I imagined.

93
00:05:45,959 --> 00:05:47,679
That's the bare minimum of proof, isn't it?

94
00:06:02,199 --> 00:06:03,359
You...

95
00:06:03,439 --> 00:06:04,040
I...

96
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:05,120
Go ahead.

97
00:06:09,199 --> 00:06:10,199
Zhao Shengge,

98
00:06:11,000 --> 00:06:12,399
can I pursue you?

99
00:06:14,920 --> 00:06:16,520
I really like you.

100
00:06:16,600 --> 00:06:18,000
Will you let me try?

101
00:06:19,120 --> 00:06:20,160
I'll treat you well.

102
00:06:20,800 --> 00:06:23,040
I'll treat you better than
anyone else in the world.

103
00:06:25,319 --> 00:06:26,559
Don't worry, though.

104
00:06:26,639 --> 00:06:28,080
I won't get in your way,

105
00:06:28,160 --> 00:06:29,160
and I won't pester you.

106
00:06:29,240 --> 00:06:30,536
If you ever feel it's not working,

107
00:06:30,560 --> 00:06:31,600
I'll stop right away.

108
00:06:31,680 --> 00:06:32,680
Is that okay?

109
00:06:34,560 --> 00:06:35,319
No.

110
00:06:35,399 --> 00:06:36,399
I could never stop.

111
00:06:37,240 --> 00:06:38,639
If he likes me even a little bit,

112
00:06:39,240 --> 00:06:40,639
I'm going to want all of him.

113
00:06:42,399 --> 00:06:44,160
You must not like me that much.

114
00:06:45,399 --> 00:06:47,255
Otherwise, why did it never
cross your mind to pursue me?

115
00:06:47,279 --> 00:06:47,879
That's not true.

116
00:06:47,959 --> 00:06:49,319
I like you so much.

117
00:06:51,360 --> 00:06:52,360
Zhao Shengge,

118
00:06:53,360 --> 00:06:54,800
can I pursue you?

119
00:06:56,959 --> 00:06:57,959
You can.

120
00:06:59,600 --> 00:07:01,600
But let's keep things separate.

121
00:07:01,680 --> 00:07:03,560
There's something I
need to make clear first.

122
00:07:04,160 --> 00:07:06,240
I don't want any
misunderstandings between us later.

123
00:07:09,959 --> 00:07:10,959
Chen Wan.

124
00:07:12,959 --> 00:07:14,319
I like you, too.

125
00:07:19,959 --> 00:07:20,959
I have feelings for you,

126
00:07:22,079 --> 00:07:23,999
even though I've never said it out loud.

127
00:07:24,079 --> 00:07:26,959
And I definitely like you more
than you could ever imagine.

128
00:07:29,079 --> 00:07:30,079
But this time,

129
00:07:33,439 --> 00:07:34,759
you made me furious.

130
00:07:35,279 --> 00:07:37,399
I can't just brush it
off and say it's fine.

131
00:07:38,680 --> 00:07:40,079
I can't get past it myself.

132
00:07:41,959 --> 00:07:43,759
So you'll have to try harder

133
00:07:43,839 --> 00:07:45,519
and put your whole heart into pursuing me.

134
00:07:46,240 --> 00:07:48,319
Only then will I consider saying yes.

135
00:07:49,879 --> 00:07:50,879
Understood?

136
00:08:34,039 --> 00:08:35,039
Everyone,

137
00:08:35,960 --> 00:08:37,719
I am truly sorry.

138
00:08:37,799 --> 00:08:38,520
Tomorrow,

139
00:08:38,600 --> 00:08:40,640
I will personally escort

140
00:08:40,720 --> 00:08:41,520
Mr. Zhao,

141
00:08:41,600 --> 00:08:42,319
Mr. Chen,

142
00:08:42,399 --> 00:08:43,559
and the Doctor

143
00:08:43,639 --> 00:08:44,639
on your voyage back.

144
00:08:45,679 --> 00:08:47,199
Let me offer another toast to you all.

145
00:08:53,360 --> 00:08:54,400
Don't let it happen again.

146
00:09:01,360 --> 00:09:02,360
You guys keep chatting.

147
00:09:03,080 --> 00:09:04,120
I'm going to get some air.

148
00:09:05,679 --> 00:09:06,720
Try some fruit.

149
00:09:07,759 --> 00:09:08,960
I'm already stuffed.

150
00:09:09,879 --> 00:09:10,880
Hello?

151
00:09:10,960 --> 00:09:12,079
What's up?

152
00:09:12,159 --> 00:09:13,159
Are you okay now?

153
00:09:13,840 --> 00:09:15,839
I'm fine. Recovering well.

154
00:09:15,919 --> 00:09:17,599
I'll be back in Haishi soon.

155
00:09:17,679 --> 00:09:18,679
Okay.

156
00:09:19,320 --> 00:09:20,520
That's all then.

157
00:09:20,600 --> 00:09:21,640
I'm going back to my game.

158
00:09:26,559 --> 00:09:27,600
Need something else?

159
00:09:28,639 --> 00:09:29,919
Don't you have something to ask?

160
00:09:30,440 --> 00:09:31,440
Nope.

161
00:09:32,000 --> 00:09:34,679
Heard Chen Wan locked
you in the panic room, though.

162
00:09:35,799 --> 00:09:36,799
So you heard.

163
00:09:39,200 --> 00:09:40,720
Chen Wan confessed his feelings to me.

164
00:09:43,480 --> 00:09:45,440
But we aren't together yet.

165
00:09:46,039 --> 00:09:47,039
What?

166
00:09:47,720 --> 00:09:49,320
Chen Wan is pursuing me right now.

167
00:10:02,039 --> 00:10:04,840
There was such a huge
security breach this time...

168
00:10:06,480 --> 00:10:07,560
I'll leave you two to talk.

169
00:10:08,120 --> 00:10:09,120
I'll excuse myself.

170
00:10:09,960 --> 00:10:10,960
Okay.

171
00:10:28,559 --> 00:10:29,559
Looking for me?

172
00:10:30,159 --> 00:10:31,159
No.

173
00:10:32,879 --> 00:10:35,000
I just came out to sober up a bit.

174
00:10:36,159 --> 00:10:37,719
Isn't there a terrace right over there?

175
00:10:39,799 --> 00:10:40,799
All right.

176
00:10:41,679 --> 00:10:43,120
I was looking for you.

177
00:10:43,200 --> 00:10:45,400
But I wasn't trying to follow you.

178
00:10:45,480 --> 00:10:48,240
I was just worried something
like last time might happen again.

179
00:10:48,320 --> 00:10:49,336
If it makes you uncomfortable—

180
00:10:49,360 --> 00:10:50,360
It doesn't.

181
00:10:51,639 --> 00:10:52,639
Besides,

182
00:10:58,720 --> 00:10:59,720
Chen Wan,

183
00:11:01,279 --> 00:11:03,479
you don't need to be so
polite when you're pursuing me.

184
00:11:06,120 --> 00:11:07,120
Really?

185
00:11:08,600 --> 00:11:10,280
I prefer someone who takes the initiative.

186
00:11:13,559 --> 00:11:14,600
I do take the initiative.

187
00:11:15,120 --> 00:11:16,199
Do you?

188
00:11:16,279 --> 00:11:17,639
I haven't felt it at all.

189
00:11:18,159 --> 00:11:19,440
What else do you like, then?

190
00:11:20,240 --> 00:11:21,960
Can you give me a few more hints?

191
00:11:30,720 --> 00:11:32,080
I like something more genuine.

192
00:11:38,600 --> 00:11:39,600
For instance,

193
00:11:41,240 --> 00:11:43,159
calling me whenever you want to,

194
00:11:44,159 --> 00:11:46,320
texting me any time you feel like it,

195
00:11:47,360 --> 00:11:49,159
and asking for whatever you want freely.

196
00:11:50,360 --> 00:11:51,519
That's what I like.

197
00:11:53,840 --> 00:11:54,840
Zhao Shengge,

198
00:11:55,360 --> 00:11:57,240
a lot of people must
have pursued you, right?

199
00:11:57,320 --> 00:11:58,320
No.

200
00:11:58,360 --> 00:11:59,720
I don't let anyone else pursue me.

201
00:11:59,799 --> 00:12:01,279
Then why are you letting me?

202
00:12:02,639 --> 00:12:03,639
Good question.

203
00:12:04,519 --> 00:12:05,840
I'll give you the answer someday.

204
00:12:08,720 --> 00:12:10,120
Zhao Shengge.

205
00:12:10,200 --> 00:12:11,679
This feels so surreal.

206
00:12:12,279 --> 00:12:13,279
Does it?

207
00:12:15,120 --> 00:12:16,759
Then let's make it a little more real.

208
00:12:41,519 --> 00:12:42,519
Chen Wan.

209
00:12:44,000 --> 00:12:45,759
You used to treat me terribly.

210
00:12:47,200 --> 00:12:48,040
Me?

211
00:12:48,120 --> 00:12:49,280
How so?

212
00:12:49,360 --> 00:12:50,480
You know perfectly well.

213
00:12:51,360 --> 00:12:53,560
Everything you gave me
before was just an afterthought.

214
00:12:54,639 --> 00:12:56,159
You seem so gentle on the surface,

215
00:12:57,120 --> 00:12:58,639
yet you have a heart of stone.

216
00:12:59,360 --> 00:13:00,600
You were never an afterthought.

217
00:13:01,120 --> 00:13:02,920
I'll treat you well.

218
00:13:03,000 --> 00:13:04,079
Very well.

219
00:13:04,159 --> 00:13:05,160
Better than anyone.

220
00:13:05,240 --> 00:13:06,240
Chen Wan.

221
00:13:06,960 --> 00:13:09,120
Actually, the things you
give to everyone else,

222
00:13:10,080 --> 00:13:11,240
I don't care for them.

223
00:13:12,440 --> 00:13:15,679
I want what you can't give to anyone else.

224
00:13:16,879 --> 00:13:18,479
Whatever you want from me,

225
00:13:18,559 --> 00:13:20,320
it's yours for the taking.

226
00:13:22,600 --> 00:13:23,960
Smooth talker.

227
00:13:37,639 --> 00:13:38,639
Wait, what?

228
00:13:40,799 --> 00:13:41,799
Come again?

229
00:13:42,679 --> 00:13:43,799
Well?

230
00:13:43,879 --> 00:13:44,879
Did you do it?

231
00:13:46,960 --> 00:13:47,839
I...

232
00:13:47,919 --> 00:13:49,000
We're not together yet.

233
00:13:49,080 --> 00:13:50,200
I'm pursuing him right now.

234
00:13:54,200 --> 00:13:56,399
Must be some new way of dating.

235
00:13:57,000 --> 00:13:58,000
Back to business.

236
00:13:59,759 --> 00:14:01,255
I want to see Monica to kick the habit.

237
00:14:01,279 --> 00:14:02,679
Okay, I'll go with you.

238
00:14:04,080 --> 00:14:04,599
Then...

239
00:14:04,679 --> 00:14:06,160
Should we tell him?

240
00:14:06,240 --> 00:14:07,599
No need.

241
00:14:07,679 --> 00:14:08,679
Alright.

242
00:14:12,399 --> 00:14:13,399
Xuan.

243
00:14:13,919 --> 00:14:15,160
Why do you think it's me?

244
00:14:15,240 --> 00:14:16,559
Who else could it be?

245
00:14:19,080 --> 00:14:20,799
I keep feeling like I'm imagining things.

246
00:14:23,519 --> 00:14:24,839
You're not.

247
00:14:24,919 --> 00:14:27,799
Zhao Shengge is head over heels for you.

248
00:14:30,799 --> 00:14:32,240
Thanks, Xuan.

249
00:14:32,320 --> 00:14:34,599
Real or not,

250
00:14:34,679 --> 00:14:36,200
there's no way I'm letting him go.

251
00:14:37,399 --> 00:14:38,399
Tell you what.

252
00:14:38,919 --> 00:14:40,159
Let me give you some pointers.

253
00:14:40,879 --> 00:14:42,360
I'm practically an expert at this.

254
00:14:43,080 --> 00:14:44,760
I'll send you some stickers first.

255
00:14:44,840 --> 00:14:46,240
Use them a lot when you text.

256
00:14:48,000 --> 00:14:49,040
Got it, Xuan.

257
00:14:49,120 --> 00:14:50,120
I already have a plan.

258
00:14:51,759 --> 00:14:52,759
Come on.

259
00:14:54,639 --> 00:14:55,640
Morning and night texts.

260
00:14:55,720 --> 00:14:57,160
Picking him up and dropping him off.

261
00:15:15,559 --> 00:15:16,559
Mr. Chen.

262
00:15:18,360 --> 00:15:19,360
What is it?

263
00:15:20,240 --> 00:15:22,120
The meeting starts in five minutes.

264
00:15:24,360 --> 00:15:25,360
Viola.

265
00:15:25,399 --> 00:15:26,696
I made some extra shrimp dumplings.

266
00:15:26,720 --> 00:15:27,360
Want to try some?

267
00:15:27,440 --> 00:15:28,839
She already ate.

268
00:15:28,919 --> 00:15:29,559
Okay.

269
00:15:29,639 --> 00:15:30,639
Time for the meeting.

270
00:15:45,840 --> 00:15:47,000
Come in.

271
00:15:47,080 --> 00:15:47,799
Mr. Zhao.

272
00:15:47,879 --> 00:15:49,280
Flowers for you.

273
00:15:49,360 --> 00:15:50,360
From Keats.

274
00:15:51,120 --> 00:15:52,559
Peonies and hydrangeas.

275
00:15:53,919 --> 00:15:54,959
Should I throw them out?

276
00:15:55,039 --> 00:15:56,280
No need.

277
00:15:56,360 --> 00:15:57,360
Find a vase.

278
00:15:58,240 --> 00:15:59,400
Just leave them here for now.

279
00:15:59,960 --> 00:16:00,960
Yes, sir.

280
00:16:18,240 --> 00:16:21,000
They look great. Just like you.

281
00:16:23,279 --> 00:16:24,279
Like me?

282
00:16:31,159 --> 00:16:32,160
What's up?

283
00:16:32,240 --> 00:16:33,240
Still not done?

284
00:16:33,840 --> 00:16:34,679
Almost.

285
00:16:34,759 --> 00:16:36,000
Does your head still hurt?

286
00:16:36,559 --> 00:16:39,040
Have some hangover soup if it does.

287
00:16:39,120 --> 00:16:40,120
I only drank a little.

288
00:16:40,960 --> 00:16:42,240
That's a relief.

289
00:16:42,320 --> 00:16:43,360
I'm coming to pick you up.

290
00:16:44,279 --> 00:16:45,559
Don't bother if it's too late.

291
00:16:45,639 --> 00:16:46,639
I'll be quick.

292
00:17:14,440 --> 00:17:16,119
Why isn't Zhao Shengge out yet?

293
00:17:17,599 --> 00:17:18,599
Let's wait a bit longer.

294
00:17:30,839 --> 00:17:31,839
Where are you?

295
00:17:32,680 --> 00:17:33,880
In the underground garage.

296
00:17:33,960 --> 00:17:35,239
It's too crowded out front.

297
00:17:35,319 --> 00:17:36,359
There are paparazzi there.

298
00:17:38,559 --> 00:17:39,559
Got it.

299
00:17:44,319 --> 00:17:45,319
Where did he go?

300
00:17:53,039 --> 00:17:53,920
What are you doing?

301
00:17:54,000 --> 00:17:54,479
Hurry.

302
00:17:54,559 --> 00:17:55,920
Paparazzi over there.

303
00:17:56,000 --> 00:17:57,119
Don't let them spot you.

304
00:18:03,599 --> 00:18:04,719
Where is he?

305
00:18:04,799 --> 00:18:06,080
Where did he disappear to?

306
00:18:06,160 --> 00:18:07,519
Told you to walk faster.

307
00:18:09,799 --> 00:18:10,640
What are you doing?

308
00:18:10,720 --> 00:18:13,080
Quiet. Paparazzi.

309
00:18:13,160 --> 00:18:14,160
I...

310
00:18:21,599 --> 00:18:22,759
Get in the car.

311
00:18:22,839 --> 00:18:23,839
Take mine.

312
00:18:36,839 --> 00:18:37,839
Chen Wan.

313
00:18:39,759 --> 00:18:41,079
Why are you staring at me?

314
00:18:42,279 --> 00:18:43,279
Zhao Shengge.

315
00:18:43,960 --> 00:18:48,000
Do you have any idea how sexy you are?

316
00:18:48,880 --> 00:18:50,000
Your lips are so red.

317
00:18:52,440 --> 00:18:54,759
Weren't you quite the
natural back in the cabin?

318
00:18:55,359 --> 00:18:56,640
Why so shy now?

319
00:19:06,440 --> 00:19:08,079
I've never seen you this forward before.

320
00:19:37,240 --> 00:19:38,519
Baby Chen Wan.

321
00:19:39,319 --> 00:19:40,319
Can I touch you?

322
00:19:41,559 --> 00:19:42,439
Yes.

323
00:19:42,519 --> 00:19:44,319
Even if I don't say yes to being with you?

324
00:19:44,880 --> 00:19:46,120
Even then.

325
00:19:46,200 --> 00:19:48,719
Even after we do this,
I still might not say yes.

326
00:19:48,799 --> 00:19:50,039
That's fine.

327
00:19:50,119 --> 00:19:51,839
You should take your time to think it over.

328
00:20:09,000 --> 00:20:10,279
You don't have to do that.

329
00:20:10,359 --> 00:20:11,839
I've never done this for anyone else.

330
00:20:12,400 --> 00:20:13,560
Twisting my words on purpose.

331
00:20:15,319 --> 00:20:16,920
This is what I want.

332
00:20:17,000 --> 00:20:18,039
You want this?

333
00:20:18,119 --> 00:20:19,119
Yeah.

334
00:21:15,200 --> 00:21:16,200
Chen Wan.

335
00:21:17,960 --> 00:21:19,000
I didn't bring [a condom].

336
00:21:19,680 --> 00:21:20,680
I brought some.

337
00:21:21,480 --> 00:21:23,199
You brought condoms just to pick me up?

338
00:21:23,279 --> 00:21:24,519
Not just this time.

339
00:21:24,599 --> 00:21:26,400
I brought them every single time I saw you.

340
00:21:27,519 --> 00:21:28,519
You wanted it that badly?

341
00:21:39,720 --> 00:21:40,799
I didn't bring a lighter.

342
00:21:41,640 --> 00:21:42,959
Zhao Shengge.

343
00:21:43,039 --> 00:21:44,200
I want you to be happy.

344
00:21:45,319 --> 00:21:47,600
I play to win.

345
00:21:47,680 --> 00:21:49,279
I hope you're surrounded by love,

346
00:21:49,359 --> 00:21:50,400
stay in good health,

347
00:21:50,480 --> 00:21:51,480
and always win.

348
00:21:53,359 --> 00:21:54,359
Zhao Shengge.

349
00:21:54,920 --> 00:21:55,920
Chen Wan.

350
00:21:56,640 --> 00:21:57,815
You really like me, don't you?

351
00:21:57,839 --> 00:21:59,120
Zhao Shengge.

352
00:21:59,200 --> 00:22:00,200
Chen Wan.

353
00:22:01,119 --> 00:22:02,119
I like you too.

354
00:22:02,960 --> 00:22:03,960
Zhao Shengge.

355
00:22:10,559 --> 00:22:11,800
Zhao Shengge.

356
00:22:11,880 --> 00:22:14,160
The fireworks look beautiful in your eyes.

357
00:22:14,240 --> 00:22:16,599
Will you set off fireworks for me again?

358
00:22:17,759 --> 00:22:18,759
Chen Wan.

359
00:22:19,799 --> 00:22:20,799
I love you.

360
00:23:26,119 --> 00:23:27,119
Come here.

361
00:23:37,079 --> 00:23:38,079
What for?

362
00:23:52,480 --> 00:23:53,759
This lighter.

363
00:23:54,359 --> 00:23:55,480
You still kept it?

364
00:23:56,480 --> 00:23:57,480
Yeah.

365
00:24:50,240 --> 00:24:51,240
Getting up?

366
00:24:52,920 --> 00:24:56,360
We have a meeting with
Dr. Fang and Mr. Xu this afternoon.

367
00:24:56,440 --> 00:24:58,120
If we get up now,

368
00:24:58,200 --> 00:24:59,200
we'll be right on time.

369
00:25:00,200 --> 00:25:01,200
Okay.

370
00:25:02,400 --> 00:25:03,400
Here.

371
00:25:50,200 --> 00:25:52,880
So the woman who took
care of me at the hospital

372
00:25:52,960 --> 00:25:54,279
works for your family?

373
00:25:55,319 --> 00:25:56,160
Yeah.

374
00:25:56,240 --> 00:25:57,840
She's looked after me since I was a kid.

375
00:25:59,640 --> 00:26:00,840
Why did you

376
00:26:00,920 --> 00:26:02,759
have her take care of me back then?

377
00:26:03,480 --> 00:26:04,959
Why do you think?

378
00:26:05,039 --> 00:26:06,039
I don't know.

379
00:26:06,960 --> 00:26:07,960
Chen Wan.

380
00:26:08,799 --> 00:26:11,279
Hiring a stranger to look after you...

381
00:26:11,359 --> 00:26:12,799
I wouldn't have felt right about it.

382
00:26:13,920 --> 00:26:15,440
You're great at taking care of others,

383
00:26:15,519 --> 00:26:17,119
but terrible at taking care of yourself.

384
00:26:23,880 --> 00:26:25,199
Hold on.

385
00:26:25,279 --> 00:26:26,400
Zhao Shengge.

386
00:26:26,480 --> 00:26:28,320
Did I do well last night?

387
00:26:28,400 --> 00:26:29,400
Did you like it?

388
00:26:31,480 --> 00:26:32,480
Chen Wan.

389
00:26:34,279 --> 00:26:36,360
How do you think I did last night?

390
00:26:36,440 --> 00:26:37,599
Did you like it?

391
00:26:42,119 --> 00:26:43,119
Chen Wan.

392
00:26:43,839 --> 00:26:45,400
You're incredible.

393
00:26:59,039 --> 00:27:00,039
Time to head out.

394
00:27:12,119 --> 00:27:13,119
Chen Wan.

395
00:27:13,799 --> 00:27:16,360
Stop instinctively waiting on people.

396
00:27:16,440 --> 00:27:18,320
You're not just anyone.

397
00:27:18,400 --> 00:27:19,400
You're Zhao Shengge.

398
00:27:28,599 --> 00:27:30,119
If you keep this up,

399
00:27:31,200 --> 00:27:32,960
we're doing it again right here.

400
00:27:36,039 --> 00:27:37,039
Put on your shoes.

401
00:27:42,480 --> 00:27:43,480
Let's go.

402
00:27:56,200 --> 00:27:57,600
Chen Wan.

403
00:27:57,680 --> 00:27:58,680
What are you looking at?

404
00:28:02,960 --> 00:28:03,960
Tell me,

405
00:28:05,000 --> 00:28:06,319
after we finished last night,

406
00:28:06,880 --> 00:28:08,800
did you hear

407
00:28:08,880 --> 00:28:10,239
what I whispered in your ear?

408
00:28:10,319 --> 00:28:11,319
What did you say?

409
00:28:13,000 --> 00:28:14,240
If you didn't catch it,

410
00:28:14,920 --> 00:28:17,400
I'll just tell you again
next time we do it.

411
00:28:25,480 --> 00:28:26,480
No need to get out.

412
00:28:28,880 --> 00:28:30,559
Take Mr. Chen to pick up his car.

413
00:28:32,920 --> 00:28:34,199
I'm off.

414
00:28:34,279 --> 00:28:35,039
Okay.

415
00:28:35,119 --> 00:28:36,119
Take care.

416
00:28:37,279 --> 00:28:38,279
Drive safe.

417
00:28:58,359 --> 00:28:58,880
Hello.

418
00:28:58,960 --> 00:28:59,439
Hi there.

419
00:28:59,519 --> 00:29:02,560
Could you wrap up the pink
hydrangeas and peonies for me?

420
00:29:02,640 --> 00:29:03,320
Sure, no problem.

421
00:29:03,400 --> 00:29:03,920
Thank you.

422
00:29:04,000 --> 00:29:04,519
By the way,

423
00:29:04,599 --> 00:29:05,880
do you have any stationery?

424
00:29:05,960 --> 00:29:06,360
Yes, we do.

425
00:29:06,440 --> 00:29:06,880
Right this way.

426
00:29:06,960 --> 00:29:07,960
Okay.

427
00:29:11,039 --> 00:29:11,759
Take a look.

428
00:29:11,839 --> 00:29:12,839
Which one would you like?

429
00:29:36,559 --> 00:29:37,559
Chen Wan,

430
00:29:38,319 --> 00:29:39,720
you're one in a million.

431
00:29:48,000 --> 00:29:50,080
Dearest Mr. Zhao Shengge,

432
00:29:50,160 --> 00:29:51,520
I hope this letter finds you well.

433
00:29:52,279 --> 00:29:53,840
I never imagined

434
00:29:53,920 --> 00:29:54,920
that one day,

435
00:29:55,000 --> 00:29:57,400
you would actually read
the letters I wrote to you.

436
00:30:04,319 --> 00:30:05,400
I don't know

437
00:30:05,480 --> 00:30:07,480
if you like this kind of confession.

438
00:30:08,240 --> 00:30:09,920
But every single day in the past,

439
00:30:10,000 --> 00:30:11,679
whenever I missed you,

440
00:30:11,759 --> 00:30:13,279
I would write you a letter.
